# Path-scoped exceptions for scripts/check-hot-cold-forbidden-apis.sh.
# Format:
# crates/<crate>/src/<file>.rs|CLASS|owner=<name>|reviewed_by=<name>|test=<evidence>|reason=<why>
#
# Class IDs include FORMAT-PRINT-001, FORMAT-DBG-001, FORMAT-JSON-001,
# FORMAT-YAML-001, MAP-STRING-001, CHANNEL-UNBOUNDED-001,
# CHANNEL-BOUNDED-001, and QUEUE-MUTEX-VECDEQUE-001.
# CHANNEL-BOUNDED-001 covers direct std::sync::mpsc::sync_channel and
# mpsc::sync_channel call syntax in hot crates. crossbeam_channel::bounded is
# intentionally outside vb-nw2sj's contract unless a later bead widens scope.
# QUEUE-MUTEX-VECDEQUE-001 covers direct Mutex<VecDeque<...>> type syntax.
# Legitimate bounded queue exceptions must stay exact path/class entries and
# cite the capacity/backpressure proof in non-empty test= or reason= metadata.
